{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國總統李在明周一（11月2日）在國會發表施政演說，介紹2027年度預算案主要內容，強調應打破僅少數人受惠的經濟發展模式，向「全民增長」轉型，實現平衡發展造福全民。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:00:48.157634+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:10:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T12:38:20.091314+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:58:06.706304+00:00","content_hash":"73325a410b204c9bfb4b32259fd9413d4ac9ebcbcaae5b2dd6dbb5ac29737f0a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}